  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Responsible and Inclusive Business Programme: Business Fights Poverty</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to:  
a.	Establish the role of business in supporting delivery of the SDGs, supported by real world examples and insights.
b.	Drive new thinking in and better understanding of the role of business in delivering the SDGs
c.	Engage with business and other stakeholders to share learning and identify new, specific on-the-ground partnerships with business
d.	Raise awareness of the FCDO&#x2019;s work on Responsible Business Conduct (RBC) with relevant stakeholders.</narrative>
  </description>
